title: murder1
---
<<MurderStart>>
{MurderText(1)}
-> I will examine the case myself. Secure the room and protect the widow.
    <<MurderChoose 1 0>>
    {MurderResult()}
-> Ask Sphrantzes for an initial inquiry, with independent copies of every statement. <<if MurderCanDelegate()>>
    <<MurderChoose 1 1>>
    {MurderResult()}
-> Suppress the rumours and close the affair. (Public morale -2; ends investigation)
    <<MurderChoose 1 2>>
    {MurderResult()}
===

title: murder2
---
{MurderText(2)}
-> Have the surgeon examine the wounds and the wax.
    <<MurderChoose 2 0>>
    {MurderResult()}
-> Interview the widow and those who saw him leave; verify their times independently.
    <<MurderChoose 2 1>>
    {MurderResult()}
-> Seal the room and let the watch preserve the file for later.
    <<MurderChoose 2 2>>
    {MurderResult()}
===

title: murder3
---
{MurderText(3)}
-> Protect the widow; compare her receipt with the harbour accounts.
    <<MurderChoose 3 0>>
    {MurderResult()}
-> Follow the collector quietly and seize his duplicate accounts.
    <<MurderChoose 3 1>>
    {MurderResult()}
-> Read the names aloud at the harbour. Someone must recognise them.
    <<MurderChoose 3 2>>
    {MurderResult()}
===

title: murder4
---
{MurderText(4)}
-> Authenticate the household records and interview witnesses separately.
    <<MurderChoose 4 0>>
    {MurderResult()}
-> Hear the implicated patron privately.
    <<MurderChoose 4 1>>
    {MurderResult()}
-> Accept the household explanation without further verification.
    <<MurderChoose 4 2>>
    {MurderResult()}
===

title: murder5
---
{MurderText(5)}
-> Reconstruct the porter's movements against the time of death.
    <<MurderChoose 5 0>>
    {MurderResult()}
-> Record his words without the watch captain present, then corroborate them.
    <<MurderChoose 5 1>>
    {MurderResult()}
-> Accept the confession and imprison the porter. (Ends investigation)
    <<MurderChoose 5 2>>
    {MurderResult()}
===

title: murder6
---
{MurderText(6)}
-> Guard the widow, plant a copied line and intercept the response.
    <<MurderChoose 6 0>>
    {MurderResult()}
-> Announce the accusation publicly and demand the missing papers.
    <<MurderChoose 6 1>>
    {MurderResult()}
-> Set no trap. Proceed with the evidence already secured.
    <<MurderChoose 6 2>>
    {MurderResult()}
===

title: murder7
---
{MurderText(7)}
-> Accuse {MurderSuspect(0)}. (Imprison if present)
    <<MurderChoose 7 0>>
    {MurderResult()}
-> Accuse {MurderSuspect(1)}. (Remove from service if present) <<if MurderAvailable(1)>>
    <<MurderChoose 7 1>>
    {MurderResult()}
-> Accuse {MurderSuspect(2)}. (Remove from service if present) <<if MurderAvailable(2)>>
    <<MurderChoose 7 2>>
    {MurderResult()}
-> Accuse {MurderSuspect(3)}. (Remove from service if present) <<if MurderAvailable(3)>>
    <<MurderChoose 7 3>>
    {MurderResult()}
-> Seal the supported case and retain the responsible household. (Public morale -3) <<if MurderCanSeal()>>
    <<MurderChoose 7 4>>
    {MurderResult()}
-> Leave the verdict open. Preserve the evidence; remove nobody.
    <<MurderChoose 7 5>>
    {MurderResult()}
===
